    "ls|LS16_S14_U_625": "O.I.H.\n \nGOVERNMENT OF INDIA\n \nMINISTRY OF AGRICULTURE AND FARMERS WELFARE\n \nDEPARTMENT OF AGRICULTURE, COOPERATION AND FARMERS WELFARE\n \n \nLOK  SABHA\n \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO.\n625\n                     \n \nTO BE ANSWERED ON THE  \n6\nTH\n \nFEBRUARY\n, 201\n8\n \n \n       \nFUNDS FOR \nDEVELOPMENT OF ALKALINE\n \nSOIL\n \n \n625. \n \nSHRI SANJAY KAKA\n \nPATIL:\n \n \nWill the Minister of AGRICULTURE AND FARMERS WELFARE\n \n  \n‡ãðŠãäÓã \nएवं \n\u0000कसान \nक\u0000याण \n½ãâ¨ããè\n \nbe pleased to state:\n \n \n \n(a) \n \nwhether the Government provides\n \nfunds under the Rashtriya Krishi Vikas\n \nYojana \n(RKVY) for the development of\n \nalkaline soil in the country and if so, the\n \ndetails thereof; \nand\n \n \n(b) \n \nwhether the Government proposes\n \nto reduce the funds being given to farmers\n \nfor \nthe development of alkaline soil and\n \nif so, the reasons therefor?\n \n \nANSWER\n \n \nM\nINISTER OF  STATE IN THE  MINISTRY OF  AGRICULTURE AND  FARMERS  WELFARE\n \n \n‡ãðŠãäÓã  \nएवं \n\u0000कसान \nक\u0000याण \n½ãâ¨ããÊã¾ã ½ãñâ Àã•¾ã ½ãâ¨ããè          \n \n( SHRI\nGAJENDRA \nSINGH SHEKHAWAT\n)  \n \n \n(a)\n \n& (b)\n:\n \nReclamation of Problem Soils (RPS) is being implemented as a \nsub\n-\nscheme of RKVY from 2016\n-\n17 by the Government to reclaim problem soil such as \nalkaline, acidic and saline to bring them under cultivation and to check further expansion \nof problem soil. States can utilize funds available under normal RKVY also besides \nfunds allocated under the sub\n-\nscheme of RPS for reclamation of alkaline soil.\n \n \n \nThe State\n-\nwise allocation and release of funds under the scheme, including fund \nreleased under the sub\n-\nscheme RPS, during 2016\n-\n17 and 2017\n-\n18 are given at \nannexure\n-\nI (a) & I (b\n).\n \n \n \n \n \n\n1\nAndhra Pradesh \n207.38\n207.38\n9.45\n9.45\n11.52\n5.76\n20.97\n228.35\n207.38\n15.21\n222.59\n2\nArunachal Pradesh\n21.35\n10.68\n2.00\n1.00\n0.47\n0.2