    "ls|LS16_S14_U_667": "GOVERNMENT OF INDIA \nMINISTRY OF AGRICULTUREAND FARMERS WELFARE \nDEPARTMENT OF ANIMAL HUSBANDRY DAIRYING AND FISHERIES \n \nLOK SABHA \n \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO- 667 \nTO BE ANSWERED ON 6th FEBRUARY, 2018 \n \nNAVIC PROGRAMME FOR FISHERMEN \n \n \n667.   MOHAMMED FAIZAL: \n \n               Will the Minister of AGRICULTURE AND FARMERS WELFARE be pleased to \nstate: \n \n(a) whether the Government is considering to implement a Satellite Navigation \nSystem/programme named ‘NAVIC’ for the welfare of fishermen in the country; \n(b)   if so, the details thereof; and  \n(c)    the details of the funds which have been allocated by the Government and utilized for this \npurpose? \n \nANSWER \n \nTHE MINISTER OF STATE FOR AGRICULTURE AND FARMERS WELFARE \n \n(SMT. KRISHNA RAJ) \n \n \n \n(a) to (c) :  The Department of Space, Government of India has informed that a  NavIC based \nmessage dissemination system  has been developed for the use of fishermen community. The \nmessages are delivered in a mobile application through a compact NavIC device. It  is also \ninformed that through this system, fishermen are alerted about high waves, approaching cyclone, \ninformation on potential fishing zone and geo-referencing applications. It is further informed that \ncurrently the system is transiting from developmental phase to initial operational phase.  \n \n \n*** \n\n ",
